@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System
participant "Spotify" as Spotify

activate User

User -> System: opens the app
alt not authenticated
  System --> User: shows the login screen

  User -> System: asks to connect with Spotify
  System --> User: opens the Spotify authorization page

  User -> Spotify: logs in and grants access
  Spotify --> System: redirects back to the app with an authorization code

  System -> Spotify: exchanges the code for access tokens
  Spotify --> System: returns access and refresh tokens
  alt login accepted
    System --> User: shows the main menu
  else cancelled, invalid redirect or token error
    System --> User: informs the login failed
  end
else already authenticated
  System --> User: shows the main menu
end
@enduml
